  <!--
    CROMS.OwnOcr - an OCR engine written from scratch for the capstone.

    The only dependencies are the .NET Framework base class library and System.Drawing
    (used for pixel access and for rendering training glyphs from installed fonts). No
    Tesseract, no OpenCV, no ML library, no NuGet package, and no reference to CROMS:
    the engine takes a Bitmap and returns text, so it can be benchmarked on its own.
  -->
